# Il2CppDumper output for the current game build: ~190 MB, including a 32 MB dump.cs,
# an 87 MB script.json and a 47 MB il2cpp.h. It has to be regenerated after every game
# update anyway, so there is no point keeping it in history.
# Regenerate with: tools/run_dumper.bat
dump/

# Third-party tools, ~220 MB of downloaded binaries (AssetRipper, Cpp2IL, Il2CppDumper,
# MelonLoader, UnityExplorer). Download them again from their own release pages;
# the versions we use are listed in README.md.
tools/

# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
.vs/
.idea/

# Per-machine GameDir override. Local.props.example is committed as the template.
src/Local.props

# Exported avatar bundles. These are built from third-party VRChat avatars and are large,
# so they stay out of the repo. Build them with the exporter in unity/AvatarExport.
DoEExport/
*.avatar
*.manifest.json

# Unity editor noise, in case a Unity project ever lands in here
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
Build/
Builds/
Logs/
UserSettings/
Assets/DoEExport_Temp/
Assets/DoEExport_Temp.meta
*.unitypackage

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
